  "body": "This feature allows the browser to read the `link` headers of subresources and use them to preload other subresources.\r\nA common use case is to preload fonts from a stylesheet.\r\nSee previous attempt to spec this: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7691\r\n\r\nThis should probably be either specified or removed from implementations.",
